/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025, November to December finished at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026 the early pairs have come in low, with February to March at 44% and April to May at 61% of normal.</p>"}
